~~disabled
% @reaction clubbox log then record club_visits person=actor box=this
~~Saved
% @reaction clubbox log enable
~~enabled
% close clubbox
~~close
% open clubbox
~~open
% @facts visits
~~box=clubbox
% close clubbox
~~close
% @facts members remove person=me group=readers
~~Removed fact
